/* Wall-surface wind pressure coefficient for low-rise buildings.
   Swami & Chandra 1988 (ASHRAE) empirical formula.

   theta   wind incidence angle relative to surface normal [rad]
   G       building side ratio, log(L/W); in livelab.mo this is the
           parameter p_log_aspect = log(0.85165)
   Cp_base normalization base pressure coefficient
*/

display2d: true$
linel: 100$

Cp_ratio : log(  1.248
               - 0.703 * sin(theta/2)
               - 1.175 * sin(theta)^2
               + 0.131 * sin(2*theta*G)^3
               + 0.769 * cos(theta/2)
               + 0.07  * G^2 * sin(theta/2)^2
               + 0.717 * cos(theta/2)^2 )$

print("Cp / Cp_base =")$
print(Cp_ratio)$
